# Project Memory: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1

## One-Line Understanding

Market/product intelligence using internal sales/PO/inventory and external market signals such as Quince data.

## Current Outcome

Find product, fabric, fitting, color, material, and market opportunities for MER/business decisions.

## Latest Update Summary

Canonical naming maps e-commerce/market intelligence/Quince discussion to MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1.

## What This Project Is

Analysis/dashboard/reporting project for product opportunity and market signal interpretation.

## What This Project Is Not

Not pure market research detached from production capability or inventory reality.

## Key Users

MER and business development users.

## Systems / Data

Sales history, customer/PO data, fabric inventory, Quince consumer data, reviews, price point, color/fit/material trend.

## Known Risks / Blockers

Requires clean sales/PO/inventory data and clear definition of market signals.

## Next Actions

Define data sources, signal rules, and opportunity output format.

## Do Not Drift Rules

- Link market signals to internal production/fabric capability.
- Keep Quince/e-commerce aliases mapped here.

